  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5804.08 Opacity Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5804.08 Opacity Standards. A vehicle will pass the opacity test if its smoke measurement is at or below the following levels for the model years indicated:\n\nTable 2. Opacity Standards\n\nOpacity Level | Model Year of Truck\n\n40% | 1991 and newer\n\n55% | 1974 to 1990\n\n70% | 1973 and older\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5800.html"
}
